---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy — OpsPrimer"
  description="What data OpsPrimer collects, and what it does not."
>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>

  <p><em>Last updated: [DATA]</em></p>

  <!-- Esta politica descreve a stack PADRAO do esqueleto:
       Cloudflare Pages + Cloudflare Web Analytics, sem cookies.
       SE VOCE ADICIONAR qualquer coisa (form do HubSpot, GA4, embed de video,
       fonte externa), ATUALIZE ESTE TEXTO. Politica desatualizada e pior que
       nenhuma. -->

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics. It does not use cookies, does not
    store any identifier on your device, and does not track you across sites.
    Aggregated, non-identifying data is used only to see which pages are read.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This site sets no cookies of its own.</p>

  <h2>Hosting and logs</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare processes standard request
    data (such as IP address) transiently to serve and protect the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some outbound links are affiliate links. When you click one, the destination
    company may set its own cookie to attribute the referral. That happens on
    their site, under their privacy policy — not this one. See the
    <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <!-- Enquanto NAO houver formulario, mantenha este paragrafo. Ao adicionar o
       form do HubSpot, substitua descrevendo: o que e coletado, para que, onde
       e armazenado (HubSpot, EUA) e como cancelar. -->
  <p>
    This site does not currently collect email addresses or run a newsletter.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can contact me at [SEU E-MAIL DE NEGOCIO] with any question about data
    on this site.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
